00:55:36.087 --> 00:55:37.947
Now, we're also using exactly

00:55:38.247 --> 00:55:40.587
n samples to sample from this policy.

00:55:41.707 --> 00:55:43.936
So the problem here is that n is being used twice

00:55:44.097 --> 00:55:46.117
and we can't really tune it in the correct

00:55:46.177 --> 00:55:48.217
