00:56:30.447 --> 00:56:32.616
a sample from some Py beta. So

00:56:32.617 --> 00:56:34.937
beta will be some tuning parameter and,

00:56:34.937 --> 00:56:36.477
you know, we'll maximize the

00:56:36.957 --> 00:56:39.117
