00:56:39.117 --> 00:56:40.657
some regularization term.

00:56:42.497 --> 00:56:44.607
So this leaves us with two questions. So

00:56:44.607 --> 00:56:46.307
the first question is, what is the regularization?

00:56:47.056 --> 00:56:49.136
And the second one is how should we actually sample

00:56:49.137 --> 00:56:50.036
