the kind of expression. So

00:59:27.736 --> 00:59:29.896
it actually takes about coverage over beta,

00:59:29.897 --> 00:59:32.127
number of samples in order to actually sample

00:59:32.127 --> 00:59:34.627
from this policy, and we'll actually see this empirically

00:59:34.687 --> 00:59:37.157
