01:00:26.276 --> 01:00:28.296
hat beta, is kind of optimal.

01:00:28.297 --> 01:00:30.427
It uses a minimal number of samples to do that.

01:00:31.787 --> 01:00:33.947
So that's a lot of theory. We can ask, does

