01:01:23.427 --> 01:01:25.547
So Okay. So this was maybe

01:01:25.547 --> 01:01:27.787
one way of solving this issue with best

01:01:27.787 --> 01:01:29.827
of then. But now we should really take a step back

01:01:29.827 --> 01:01:31.886
and try and kind of figure out what are the issues

01:01:32.127 --> 01:01:34.286
this. Right? For one, we did not see that much

01:01:34.286 --> 01:01:36.306
of a lift in the kind of ceiling of performance.

