policy and reward

01:01:49.537 --> 01:01:51.766
level pessimism. And

01:01:51.827 --> 01:01:53.857
two, is we're gonna ask, you know, is

01:01:53.857 --> 01:01:56.097
the metric that we're actually targeting here, which

