we can ask you know, why is this even called infincent

01:02:45.517 --> 01:02:47.447
time pessimism and the answer

01:02:47.587 --> 01:02:49.907
is really from RL. So a lot of my background

01:02:49.907 --> 01:02:52.177
is in RL, if you're not familiar with

