01:04:37.667 --> 01:04:39.907
Well, if the rewards are pessimistic, right, we cannot

01:04:39.907 --> 01:04:41.966
reward hack. And the kind of classical

01:04:41.967 --> 01:04:43.746
way to kind of instantiate pessimistic

01:04:44.046 --> 01:04:46.257
rewards is you introduce uncertainty estimates.

01:04:46.797 --> 01:04:48.907
So we'll say u of x y this

01:04:48.907 --> 01:04:50.987
will be some measure of how much do

01:04:50.987 --> 01:04:52.847
we know about this generation y.

01:04:53.137 --> 01:04:55.377
And we'll then force our pessimism by just

01:04:55.377 --> 01:04:57.397
subtracting uncertainty from the estimated

01:04:57.457 --> 01:04:59.627
reward. R hat. So the idea

01:04:59.627 --> 01:05:01.707
here is that if our uncertainty is small,

01:05:01.947 --> 01:05:04.267
when r hat is actually a good estimator, which happens

01:05:04.267 --> 01:05:06.287
on kind of typical generations

01:05:06.287 --> 01:05:08.346
and it's large otherwise, then this will

01:05:08.347 --> 01:05:10.366
indeed be a pessimistic reward estimate.

01:05:11.167 --> 01:05:13.407
So then the natural question is, how do you actually get

01:05:13.407 --> 01:05:15.536
this uncertainty estimate? And

01:05:15.536 --> 01:05:17.556
we kind of borrow some ideas from

01:05:17.617 --> 01:05:18.517
a more classical

01:05:21.756 --> 01:05:23.787
where from about almost ten years

01:05:23.787 --> 01:05:26.076
ago now, to kind of construct

01:05:26.077 --> 01:05:28.237
this uncertainty quant. Now

01:05:28.237 --> 01:05:30.316
there's a lot of empirical details that

01:05:30.316 --> 01:05:31.807
go into this, but but

01:05:32.327 --> 01:05:34.566
if you believe this, then you should maybe

01:05:34.566 --> 01:05:36.816
believe that this, using best event with these

01:05:36.817 --> 01:05:39.097
kind of pessimistic reward estimates will actually

01:05:39.617 --> 01:05:41.797
perform better. And in fact, that is the case.

01:05:42.037 --> 01:05:44.437
So the green is our kind of pessimistically constructed

01:05:44.437 --> 01:05:46.697
reward and the other colors

01:05:46.867 --> 01:05:48.417
kind of different notions of reward.

01:05:48.897 --> 01:05:50.977
And here we actually do see an improvement

