03:22:53.108 --> 03:22:55.158
the unseen, like, the novelty come in.

03:22:55.158 --> 03:22:57.317
It's not just if it's valid. And I think

03:22:57.317 --> 03:22:59.318
maybe what you're also referring to is there's

03:22:59.318 --> 03:23:01.518
a third notion of creativity that we didn't

03:23:01.518 --> 03:23:03.328
get into, and it's much harder to think about, which

03:23:03.568 --> 03:23:05.348
is what Bogen calls transformative

03:23:05.808 --> 03:23:07.908
creativity. So in all of these cases, we

03:23:07.908 --> 03:23:10.328
assume there is a right there is a structure

03:23:10.408 --> 03:23:12.487
So, like and we want to generate new things

03:23:12.488 --> 03:23:14.518
following roughly that structure. But then

03:23:14.518 --> 03:23:16.598
maybe the rules of the game are itself wrong and we

03:23:16.598 --> 03:23:19.008
need to re like, you know, rechange the whole rules.

03:23:19.168 --> 03:23:21.248
And that is, like, the transformative creativity set

03:23:21.248 --> 03:23:23.447
up. Like, maybe we don't really care about siblings,

03:23:23.448 --> 03:23:25.678
and we should be caring about something else. So, like, that

03:23:25.678 --> 03:23:27.698
the kind of creativity that's, like, even harder to,

03:23:27.698 --> 03:23:29.708
like, figure, like, what are the right toy tasks

03:23:29.708 --> 03:23:31.848
or, like, how do we think about that? So

03:23:31.848 --> 03:23:33.928
that's another interesting direction of future work, which

03:23:33.928 --> 03:23:35.958
is, like, the third axis of creativity.

03:23:36.978 --> 03:23:39.328
But in these two in these two setups, like, we

03:23:39.728 --> 03:23:41.908
exactly care about the thing that we don't just care

03:23:42.128 --> 03:23:44.167
about correctness, we care about the value. And in

03:23:44.168 --> 03:23:46.247
our case, the value is just is it novel?

03:23:46.248 --> 03:23:48.718
Is it new? And is it adding knowledge beyond

03:23:48.938 --> 03:23:51.288
the training data? And that's how we measure that in our setup.

