08:06:46.868 --> 08:06:49.158
bar for these papers, and I think that's important. Right?

08:06:49.638 --> 08:06:51.738
Because you wanna understand, like, why

08:06:51.738 --> 08:06:53.938
is it a failure and what's going on.

08:06:53.938 --> 08:06:56.348
But I think I'm curious hear from all of you

08:06:56.488 --> 08:06:58.908
about is what would you wanna see in a great

08:06:59.128 --> 08:07:01.230
negative result paper at NERIPS?

08:07:04.558 --> 08:07:06.858
Maybe I can start by saying

08:07:07.178 --> 08:07:09.178
the idea of having negative results in,

08:07:09.579 --> 08:07:11.278
at neurons is not new.

08:07:12.448 --> 08:07:14.669
Been tried many times, and it's failed

08:07:14.669 --> 08:07:17.009
many times, unfortunately. But,

08:07:18.138 --> 08:07:20.298
I think it's great that we try to make it

08:07:20.298 --> 08:07:22.348
work. The the main reason why it

08:07:22.589 --> 08:07:24.749
failed many times I mean, there are a couple,

08:07:24.749 --> 08:07:27.068
but the first one is, when someone says

08:07:27.068 --> 08:07:29.158
this doesn't work, there are so many

08:07:29.158 --> 08:07:31.298
ways a thing cannot work. Most

08:07:31.298 --> 08:07:33.468
of them are just because you didn't do it

08:07:33.468 --> 08:07:34.868
well. And so,

08:07:36.398 --> 08:07:38.581
so it's very easy to to

08:07:38.581 --> 08:07:40.668
look bad, because you say

08:07:41.054 --> 08:07:43.228
that this thing doesn't work. And

08:07:43.228 --> 08:07:45.548
so you are not going to be very much encouraged

08:07:45.548 --> 08:07:47.708
to actually tell us that this thing doesn't work

08:07:47.708 --> 08:07:49.767
because you're you're like a you

08:07:49.767 --> 08:07:52.088
look weak by telling us that actually

08:07:52.088 --> 08:07:54.378
you might be be not thinking about

08:07:54.378 --> 08:07:56.368
everything. So I think a good

08:07:56.608 --> 08:07:58.768
paper that is a negative result is a paper that

08:07:58.768 --> 08:08:00.928
cannot be attacked by any angle like

08:08:00.928 --> 08:08:02.598
that. So it's going to be very

08:08:03.298 --> 08:08:05.518
difficult but you have to actually find the reason

08:08:05.518 --> 08:08:07.398
