08:08:12.308 --> 08:08:14.468
the negative result is still useful for

08:08:14.468 --> 08:08:16.498
some reason. So, it is going to

08:08:16.498 --> 08:08:18.708
be hard, but it's going to be very impactful.

08:08:18.708 --> 08:08:21.188
If people are willing to play that much

08:08:21.329 --> 08:08:23.478
harder game. So

