08:09:48.558 --> 08:09:50.818
we actually also tried this thing.

08:09:51.228 --> 08:09:53.388
And it's not just us. It's kind of something that

08:09:53.388 --> 08:09:55.489
many people have been trying. And it

08:09:55.489 --> 08:09:57.570
doesn't work. But we need to specify. It doesn't

08:09:57.570 --> 08:09:59.847
work in this specific condition because of

08:09:59.847 --> 08:10:02.088
this and because of that. A real one, if you really want to

08:10:02.088 --> 08:10:04.468
push it, I have seen some papers with negative results,

08:10:04.688 --> 08:10:06.848
it's conferences. The it's not that they don't

08:10:06.848 --> 08:10:09.027
exist, but they have to put extra

08:10:09.027 --> 08:10:11.298
effort. There has to be analysis. They have to kind of

08:10:11.298 --> 08:10:13.088
very clear documentation. Right?

08:10:13.328 --> 08:10:14.626
It makes sense, what was done.

08:10:15.658 --> 08:10:17.818
To me, it's easier actually to incorporate into

